    }
}
```
- Read from request: it is a field of `OwnerFields` in the OpenAPI schema (`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/resources/openapi.yml` lines 2043-2048, "Optional; defaults to the server's current date when not supplied"). The generated `OwnerFieldsDto` is mapped to `Owner` by MapStruct via `toOwner(OwnerFieldsDto)` in `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/mapper/OwnerMapper.java` (lines 25-27), invoked from `BuildOwner.java` (line 11-13). MapStruct auto-maps the matching `registrationDate` field name.
