owner.setMembershipNumber(String.format("%s-M%02d", owner.getCustomerCode(), yy));
```
- Depends on customer code from `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/function/owner/AssignCustomerCode.java` (lines 18-23; format `<CITY3>-<LAST3>-<NNNN>`, sequence = `countByCity + 1`).
