### Date / business-day utilities

None exist. A codebase-wide search of `src/main` for `businessDay|weekend|SATURDAY|SUNDAY|DayOfWeek|plusDays|nextBusiness|rollForward` returned zero matches. The only business-day reference is in the test (`AcceptanceTest.java`, importing `java.time.DayOfWeek`). Any business-day rolling logic would need to be added.

